{"name":"Greensboro","hex":"#565c00","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Greensboro","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A locale in the United States:\nA city, the county seat of Hale County, Alabama; named for Nathanael Greene.\nA town in Gadsden County, Florida; named for founder J. W. Green.\nA city, the county seat of Greene County, Georgia; named for Nathanael Greene.\nA township and town therein, in Henry County, Indiana; named for the city in North Carolina.\nA town in Caroline County, Maryland; named for Nathanael Greene.\nA city, the county seat of Guilford County, North Carolina; named for American Revolutionary War general Nathanael Greene. \nA borough in Greene County, Pennsylvania; named for Nathanael Greene.\nA town and census-designated place therein, in Orleans County, Vermont; named for landowner Timothy Green.","A city, the county seat of Hale County, Alabama; named for Nathanael Greene."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Greensboro"}],"entries":[{"title":"Greensboro, North Carolina","blocks":[{"text":"Greensboro is a city in Guilford County, North Carolina, United States, and its county seat. The Greensboro–High Point metropolitan area has an estimated 801,000 residents, with the metropolitan area also encompassing the overall center of North Carolina. The city of Greensboro is the most populous city in Piedmont Triad region of North Carolina, home to about 1.7 million residents. The population of the city of Greensboro was 299,035 in the 2020 census and estimated at 308,667 in 2025, making it the third-most populous city in North Carolina and the 67th-most populous city in the U.S."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Greensboro_Skyline.jpg/330px-Greensboro_Skyline.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greensboro%2C_North_Carolina","wikidata":"Q49238"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Carolina_Theatre%2C_Greensboro%2C_NC_%2848992667338%29.jpg/500px-Carolina_Theatre%2C_Greensboro%2C_NC_%2848992667338%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Carolina_Theatre%2C_Greensboro%2C_NC_%2848992667338%29.jpg/1280px-Carolina_Theatre%2C_Greensboro%2C_NC_%2848992667338%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Carolina_Theatre%2C_Greensboro%2C_NC_%2848992667338%29.jpg/500px-Carolina_Theatre%2C_Greensboro%2C_NC_%2848992667338%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACarolina_Theatre%2C_Greensboro%2C_NC_(48992667338).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/J._Douglas_Galyon_Depot_%28Southern_Railway_Station%29%2C_Greensboro%2C_NC_%2848993208806%29.jpg/500px-J._Douglas_Galyon_Depot_%28Southern_Railway_Station%29%2C_Greensboro%2C_NC_%2848993208806%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/J._Douglas_Galyon_Depot_%28Southern_Railway_Station%29%2C_Greensboro%2C_NC_%2848993208806%29.jpg/1280px-J._Douglas_Galyon_Depot_%28Southern_Railway_Station%29%2C_Greensboro%2C_NC_%2848993208806%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/J._Douglas_Galyon_Depot_%28Southern_Railway_Station%29%2C_Greensboro%2C_NC_%2848993208806%29.jpg/500px-J._Douglas_Galyon_Depot_%28Southern_Railway_Station%29%2C_Greensboro%2C_NC_%2848993208806%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJ._Douglas_Galyon_Depot_(Southern_Railway_Station)%2C_Greensboro%2C_NC_(4